<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Welcome to VenTrack - Admin Invitation</title>
    <style>
        /* Email Template Width Strategy:
         * - Desktop: Fixed 600px max-width, centered
         * - Tablet (640px and below): Full width with 10px margins
         * - Mobile (480px and below): Full width with 8px margins
         * - All devices: Responsive padding and content scaling
         */

        /* Reset and base styles */
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #1a1a1a;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f5f7fa 0%, #c3cfe2 100%);
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 0;
            width: 100%;
        }

        .email-container {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 16px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        /* Header Section */
        .header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            padding: 40px 30px;
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
        }

        .header::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            bottom: 0;
            background: url('data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 100 100"><defs><pattern id="grain" width="100" height="100" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><circle cx="25" cy="25" r="1" fill="%23ffffff" opacity="0.1"/><circle cx="75" cy="75" r="1" fill="%23ffffff" opacity="0.1"/><circle cx="50" cy="10" r="0.5" fill="%23ffffff" opacity="0.1"/></pattern></defs><rect width="100" height="100" fill="url(%23grain)"/></svg>');
            opacity: 0.3;
        }

        .logo {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .logo h1 {
            color: #ffffff;
            font-size: 32px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
        }

        .logo .tagline {
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 400;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }

        /* Main Content */
        .content {
            padding: 40px 30px;
        }

        .welcome-section {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        .welcome-section h2 {
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #1a1a1a;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .welcome-section .role-badge {
            display: inline-block;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 6px 16px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 500;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }

        .greeting {
            font-size: 18px;
            color: #4a5568;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }

        .intro-text {
            font-size: 16px;
            color: #4a5568;
            line-height: 1.7;
            margin-bottom: 32px;
        }

        /* Invitation Details Card */
        .invite-card {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f8fafc 0%, #e2e8f0 100%);
            border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 24px;
            margin: 32px 0;
            position: relative;
        }

        .invite-card::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            left: 0;
            top: 0;
            bottom: 0;
            width: 4px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            border-radius: 4px 0 0 4px;
        }

        .invite-card h3 {
            color: #1a1a1a;
            font-size: 20px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            padding-left: 16px;
        }

        .detail-row {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            padding: 8px 16px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
            border-radius: 8px;
        }

        .detail-label {
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #4a5568;
            min-width: 120px;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .detail-value {
            color: #1a1a1a;
            font-size: 14px;
            flex: 1;
        }

        .password-code {
            background: #1a1a1a;
            color: #00ff88;
            padding: 4px 8px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-family: 'Monaco', 'Menlo', 'Ubuntu Mono', monospace;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 500;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }

        /* CTA Button */
        .cta-section {
            text-align: center;
            margin: 40px 0;
        }

        .cta-button {
            display: inline-block;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            color: #ffffff;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 16px 32px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.3);
            transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .cta-button::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: -100%;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2), transparent);
            transition: left 0.5s;
        }

        .cta-button:hover::before {
            left: 100%;
        }

        .cta-button:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 12px 35px rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.4);
        }

        .cta-text {
            font-size: 16px;
            color: #4a5568;
            margin: 16px 0;
        }

        /* Security Notice */
        .security-notice {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fffbeb 0%, #fef3c7 100%);
            border: 1px solid #f59e0b;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 32px 0;
            position: relative;
        }

        .security-notice::before {
            content: '⚠️';
            position: absolute;
            top: 20px;
            left: 20px;
            font-size: 18px;
        }

        .security-notice h4 {
            color: #92400e;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            padding-left: 28px;
        }

        .security-notice ul {
            color: #78350f;
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            padding-left: 28px;
        }

        .security-notice li {
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }

        /* Capabilities Section */
        .capabilities {
            margin: 40px 0;
        }

        .capabilities h3 {
            color: #1a1a1a;
            font-size: 20px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .capabilities ul {
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
        }

        .capabilities li {
            background: #f8fafc;
            border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 12px 16px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #4a5568;
            position: relative;
            padding-left: 40px;
        }

        .capabilities li::before {
            content: '✓';
            position: absolute;
            left: 16px;
            top: 12px;
            color: #10b981;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 16px;
        }

        /* Support Section */
        .support-section {
            background: #f8fafc;
            border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 32px 0;
        }

        .support-section h4 {
            color: #1a1a1a;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .support-section p {
            color: #4a5568;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .url-display {
            background: #1a1a1a;
            color: #00ff88;
            padding: 12px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-family: 'Monaco', 'Menlo', 'Ubuntu Mono', monospace;
            font-size: 12px;
            word-break: break-all;
            border: 1px solid #374151;
        }

        /* Footer */
        .footer {
            background: #1a1a1a;
            color: #9ca3af;
            padding: 24px 30px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .footer .brand {
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #ffffff;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .footer p {
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.5;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }

        .footer .divider {
            height: 1px;
            background: #374151;
            margin: 16px 0;
        }

        /* Responsive Design */
        @media (max-width: 640px) {
            body {
                padding: 10px;
            }

            .email-container {
                width: calc(100% - 20px);
                max-width: 100%;
                margin: 0 10px;
                border-radius: 12px;
            }

            .header {
                padding: 30px 20px;
            }

            .logo h1 {
                font-size: 28px;
            }

            .content {
                padding: 30px 20px;
            }

            .welcome-section h2 {
                font-size: 24px;
            }

            .detail-row {
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: flex-start;
                gap: 4px;
            }

            .detail-label {
                min-width: auto;
                width: 100%;
            }

            .cta-button {
                width: 100%;
                padding: 14px 24px;
                font-size: 15px;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            .email-container {
                width: calc(100% - 16px);
                margin: 0 8px;
                border-radius: 8px;
            }

            .header {
                padding: 24px 16px;
            }

            .content {
                padding: 24px 16px;
            }

            .invite-card {
                padding: 20px;
            }

            .detail-row {
                padding: 12px 16px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="email-container">
        <!-- Header -->
        <div class="header">
            <div class="logo">
                <h1>VenTrack</h1>
                <p class="tagline">Secure. Compliant. Simple.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Main Content -->
        <div class="content">
            <!-- Welcome Section -->
            <div class="welcome-section">
                <h2>Welcome to VenTrack!</h2>
                <p>You've been invited to join as a <span class="role-badge">Company Administrator</span></p>
            </div>

            <!-- Greeting and Intro -->
            <div class="greeting">
                Hello <strong>{{adminName}}</strong>,
            </div>

            <div class="intro-text">
                You have been invited by <strong>{{inviterName}}</strong> to join VenTrack as a Company Administrator. This role will allow you to manage vendor compliance for your assigned company.
            </div>

            <!-- Invitation Details -->
            <div class="invite-card">
                <h3>Invitation Details</h3>
                <div class="detail-row">
                    <span class="detail-label">Invited by:</span>
                    <span class="detail-value">{{inviterName}} ({{inviterEmail}})</span>
                </div>
                <div class="detail-row">
                    <span class="detail-label">Role:</span>
                    <span class="detail-value">Company Administrator</span>
                </div>
                <div class="detail-row">
                    <span class="detail-label">Temp Password:</span>
                    <span class="detail-value"><span class="password-code">{{tempPassword}}</span></span>
                </div>
                <div class="detail-row">
                    <span class="detail-label">Expires:</span>
                    <span class="detail-value">{{expiresAt}}</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- CTA Section -->
            <div class="cta-section">
                <p class="cta-text">To get started, please click the button below to accept your invitation and set up your account:</p>
                <a href="{{inviteUrl}}" class="cta-button">
                    Accept Invitation & Set Password
                </a>
            </div>

            <!-- Security Notice -->
            <div class="security-notice">
                <h4>Important Security Information</h4>
                <ul>
                    <li>Use the temporary password above to log in for the first time</li>
                    <li>You will be required to change your password immediately after login</li>
                    <li>This invitation link will expire in 24 hours for your security</li>
                    <li>If you did not expect this invitation, please ignore this email</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <!-- Capabilities -->
            <div class="capabilities">
                <h3>What you can do as a Company Administrator:</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>Manage vendor compliance data</li>
                    <li>Handle document uploads and tracking</li>
                    <li>Oversee user access within your company</li>
                    <li>Generate compliance reports</li>
                    <li>Configure company-specific settings</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <!-- Help Text -->
            <div class="intro-text">
                If you have any questions about your role or need assistance getting started, please don't hesitate to reach out to your system administrator.
            </div>

            <!-- Support Section -->
            <div class="support-section">
                <h4>Need Help?</h4>
                <p>If the button above doesn't work, you can copy and paste this link into your browser:</p>
                <div class="url-display">{{inviteUrl}}</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Footer -->
        <div class="footer">
            <div class="brand">VenTrack</div>
            <p>Vendor Compliance Tracking System</p>
            <div class="divider"></div>
            <p>This is an automated message. Please do not reply to this email.</p>
            <p>If you have questions, contact your system administrator.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>